"Отмените оплату на терминале, прежде чем выбрать другой способ оплаты."

#: includes/Payments/OrderPay/Order_Pay_Panel.php:68
#: includes/Payments/OrderPay/Order_Pay_Panel.php:135
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Отмена"

#: includes/Payments/OrderPay/Order_Pay_Panel.php:69
#: includes/Payments/OrderPay/Order_Pay_Panel.php:136
msgid "Try again"
msgstr "Повторить"

#: includes/Payments/OrderPay/Order_Pay_Panel.php:70
#: includes/Payments/OrderPay/Order_Pay_Panel.php:130
msgid "Terminal"
msgstr "Терминал"

#: includes/Payments/OrderPay/Order_Pay_Panel.php:71
msgid "No terminal is available. Check the terminal settings."
msgstr "Нет доступного терминала. Проверьте его настройки."

#. translators: %s: amount and currency.
#: includes/Payments/OrderPay/Order_Pay_Panel.php:73
#, php-format
msgid "Ready to send %s to the terminal."
msgstr "Готово к отправке на терминал: %s."

#: includes/Payments/OrderPay/Order_Pay_Panel.php:74
msgid "Sending to the terminal…"
msgstr "Отправка на терминал…"

#: includes/Payments/OrderPay/Order_Pay_Panel.php:75
msgid "Waiting for the customer at the terminal…"
msgstr "Ожидание покупателя у терминала…"

#: includes/Payments/OrderPay/Order_Pay_Panel.php:76
msgid "Approved — finishing…"
msgstr "Одобрено — завершаем…"

#: includes/Payments/OrderPay/Order_Pay_Panel.php:77
msgid "Paid. Finishing the order…"
msgstr "Оплачено. Завершаем заказ…"

#: includes/Payments/OrderPay/Order_Pay_Panel.php:78
msgid "Cancelling — waiting for the terminal to confirm…"
msgstr "Отмена — ожидаем подтверждения от терминала…"

#: includes/Payments/OrderPay/Order_Pay_Panel.php:79
msgid "Cancelled on the terminal. Nothing was charged."
msgstr "Отменено на терминале. Списание не выполнено."

#: includes/Payments/OrderPay/Order_Pay_Panel.php:80
msgid "The terminal declined or cancelled the payment."
msgstr "Терминал отклонил или отменил платёж."

#: includes/Payments/OrderPay/Order_Pay_Panel.php:81
msgid "Card declined."
msgstr "Карта отклонена."

#: includes/Payments/OrderPay/Order_Pay_Panel.php:82
msgid "No card was presented in time."
msgstr "Карту не предъявили вовремя."

#: includes/Payments/OrderPay/Order_Pay_Panel.php:83
msgid ""
"The amount confirmed by the terminal did not match. Check the terminal and the order."
msgstr ""
"Сумма, подтверждённая терминалом, не совпадает. Проверьте терминал и заказ."

#: includes/Payments/OrderPay/Order_Pay_Panel.php:85
msgid ""
"A payment with another method is already in progress on this order. Finish or cancel it first."
msgstr ""
"Для этого заказа уже выполняется оплата другим способом. Сначала завершите или отмените её."

#: includes/Payments/OrderPay/Order_Pay_Panel.php:86
msgid "Resuming a payment already in progress…"
msgstr "Возобновление уже выполняющегося платежа…"

#: includes/Payments/OrderPay/Order_Pay_Panel.php:87
msgid ""
"Your register session is about to expire. Reopen this payment from the register."
msgstr "Сеанс кассы скоро завершится. Откройте этот платёж заново в кассе."

#: includes/Payments/OrderPay/Order_Pay_Panel.php:88
msgid ""
"Lost the connection to your register session. The payment continues on the terminal and will be recorded; reopen this payment from the register to see the result."
msgstr ""
"Соединение с сеансом кассы потеряно. Оплата продолжается на терминале и будет записана; откройте этот платёж заново в кассе, чтобы увидеть результат."

#: includes/Payments/OrderPay/Order_Pay_Panel.php:89
msgid "No answer from the terminal in five minutes — cancelling."
msgstr "Терминал не ответил за пять минут — отменяем."

#: includes/Payments/OrderPay/Order_Pay_Panel.php:90
msgid "Can't reach the store — retrying…"
msgstr "Не удаётся связаться с магазином — повторная попытка…"

#: includes/Payments/OrderPay/Order_Pay_Panel.php:91
msgid "The terminal moved on. Showing its current state."
